  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-1",
      "transcript": "What if an animal could reverse its own life cycle?",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 3.35,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.58c80ee968e305cd253bd812bf1a3b202eb7a5350daf4b05969c51e1ce1c1c79",
        "sha256": "58c80ee968e305cd253bd812bf1a3b202eb7a5350daf4b05969c51e1ce1c1c79"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-2",
      "transcript": "This is Turritopsis dohrnii.",
      "start": 3.533333333333333,
      "duration": 2.275,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.59be33a2017f2e0c7ed8b055489835bd952ae879783208b72a70dedfdf6f9181",
        "sha256": "59be33a2017f2e0c7ed8b055489835bd952ae879783208b72a70dedfdf6f9181"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Normally, attached polyps bud off tiny jellyfish, which grow into swimming adults.",
      "start": 5.966666666666667,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.0467becf00524871ea3387276554d17b6131fd1ac21dc344c8665b700b8daf30",
        "sha256": "0467becf00524871ea3387276554d17b6131fd1ac21dc344c8665b700b8daf30"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-4",
      "transcript": "But injury or starvation can send an adult another way.",
      "start": 11.8,
      "duration": 4.225,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.9d462c33ffca9d7af7bacf8e01c6d414056f0c71e30f64a510727ab9739f9e3e",
        "sha256": "9d462c33ffca9d7af7bacf8e01c6d414056f0c71e30f64a510727ab9739f9e3e"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Its bell collapses. Its tentacles disappear. It settles into a cyst-like mass.",
      "start": 16.2,
      "duration": 5.75,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.3eaecf949ead1ae24be3a5dbe94e09a6cc85a34b75abd81ceeeb499104d2ef7a",
        "sha256": "3eaecf949ead1ae24be3a5dbe94e09a6cc85a34b75abd81ceeeb499104d2ef7a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-6",
      "transcript": "Inside, cells reorganize. Some can change their specialized identity: transdifferentiation.",
      "start": 22.166666666666668,
      "duration": 6.725,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.e929b61dd0a66ac9cdef97b0962652d24374301b7618b58038e7355953904695",
        "sha256": "e929b61dd0a66ac9cdef97b0962652d24374301b7618b58038e7355953904695"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-7",
      "transcript": "A stolon grows, then polyps. That colony can bud new jellyfish.",
      "start": 29.133333333333333,
      "duration": 4.775,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.f3e9b09f83b0face6546697c3b7e3b24d4342fa9b3e1b79ea6f1a241e796c248",
        "sha256": "f3e9b09f83b0face6546697c3b7e3b24d4342fa9b3e1b79ea6f1a241e796c248"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Life-cycle reversal can happen repeatedly in laboratory cultures.",
      "start": 34.233333333333334,
      "duration": 4.9,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.73e95bc89978c637e65744bc275f7b187d006021c83e659a2b9f99edc5130b41",
        "sha256": "73e95bc89978c637e65744bc275f7b187d006021c83e659a2b9f99edc5130b41"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-9",
      "transcript": "The molecular controls are still being studied.",
      "start": 39.3,
      "duration": 3,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.2c556f0a37ffe56ae955730f6930be65ff3128b9bf69115d0d268c29e2b3de16",
        "sha256": "2c556f0a37ffe56ae955730f6930be65ff3128b9bf69115d0d268c29e2b3de16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-10",
      "transcript": "But predators can still kill it. Reversal isn't guaranteed survival.",
      "start": 42.46666666666667,
      "duration": 4.625,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.0b8e7c3ef570f0e079bfa7570e586c2192c8cdfd54df790b3dc29e7a93451243",
        "sha256": "0b8e7c3ef570f0e079bfa7570e586c2192c8cdfd54df790b3dc29e7a93451243"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "jellyfish-reversal-cue-11",
      "transcript": "It doesn't make death impossible. It makes the direction of development reversible.",
      "start": 47.333333333333336,
      "duration": 5.375,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.9582a3a0cdf61052fa65cbc2520d416c4adab92918c1dbb827d38c3b75853a00",
        "sha256": "9582a3a0cdf61052fa65cbc2520d416c4adab92918c1dbb827d38c3b75853a00"
      }
    }
  ],
